WEBVTT

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:23.050
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:30.190
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:36.870
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:42.840
I was searching for your smile

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:50.210
With our memories fading

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:57.290
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:04.190
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:11.410
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:36.960
Valon, one of Doma's Three Musketeers, has amazing dueling skills.

00:01:36.960 --> 00:01:43.150
Every attack hurts my body, making my organs scream in pain.

00:01:43.150 --> 00:01:46.520
But I’m not giving up!

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:53.890
To get Mai back and crush Doma, I can't lose to you!

00:01:55.600 --> 00:02:01.600
Resonating Souls

00:02:17.190 --> 00:02:18.660
And with that...

00:02:22.380 --> 00:02:24.240
I did it, Grandpa!

00:02:24.240 --> 00:02:25.820
You got through.

00:02:25.820 --> 00:02:28.330
I can’t wait any longer!

00:02:29.100 --> 00:02:31.680
I’m going to look for Jonouchi!

00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:33.160
Calm down, Honda.

00:02:33.160 --> 00:02:34.330
That’s right.

00:02:34.330 --> 00:02:37.340
You’re wasting time if you don’t know where to go.

00:02:38.080 --> 00:02:45.070
Valon isn't the only one after Jonouchi!  Mai is too!

00:02:45.390 --> 00:02:49.160
If Jonouchi has to duel Mai again…

00:02:49.160 --> 00:02:52.670
Yeah.  Jonouchi can’t fight her.

00:02:52.670 --> 00:02:55.820
Mai already knows Jonouchi will go for a draw.

00:02:56.520 --> 00:02:58.530
So that won't be easy.

00:02:58.530 --> 00:02:59.800
Yeah.

00:03:01.030 --> 00:03:03.390
I found Jonouchi's location!

00:03:03.390 --> 00:03:04.310
Really?

00:03:04.310 --> 00:03:07.650
Umm...  He's downtown.

00:03:09.130 --> 00:03:11.420
Go somewhere safe.

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:13.570
I’ll find Jonouchi.

00:03:13.970 --> 00:03:16.310
No!  I’m coming with you!

00:03:16.680 --> 00:03:19.000
She’s right!  I’m coming too!

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:20.990
Anzu...  Honda...

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:23.820
Okay.  Let’s go!

00:03:25.640 --> 00:03:29.820
Otogi, look after Rebecca and Professor Hopkins.

00:03:30.610 --> 00:03:32.840
What?  I wanna come too!

00:03:32.840 --> 00:03:34.370
Grandpa?

00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:37.210
We've done our job.

00:03:37.210 --> 00:03:39.320
We'll only be getting in their way.

00:03:40.810 --> 00:03:43.840
Rebecca, will you trust me?

00:03:44.990 --> 00:03:46.840
The other Yugi...

00:03:47.900 --> 00:03:50.340
I promise to save my partner.

00:03:53.370 --> 00:03:55.770
Get back safe!

00:03:55.770 --> 00:03:57.890
I promise to protect these two!

00:03:57.890 --> 00:03:59.350
Okay!  Thanks!

00:03:59.830 --> 00:04:01.620
Let’s hurry, Yugi.

00:04:02.360 --> 00:04:03.860
Be careful!

00:04:04.460 --> 00:04:05.440
Right!

00:04:10.490 --> 00:04:11.700
Don't worry.

00:04:12.050 --> 00:04:15.540
He won't let darkness tempt him anymore.

00:04:15.930 --> 00:04:17.170
Grandpa...

00:04:17.170 --> 00:04:20.700
Trust the other Yugi.

00:04:20.700 --> 00:04:21.750
Okay.

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:26.600
Everything rests on your shoulders.

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:29.450
Save the world, Nameless Pharaoh.

00:04:29.450 --> 00:04:33.480
Save my darling, the other Yugi.

00:04:44.420 --> 00:04:46.460
I'll bet on this card!

00:04:46.880 --> 00:04:48.230
What's that card?

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:53.010
I summon Brigadier of Landstar in attack position!

00:04:55.960 --> 00:04:59.700
I activate the spell card, Monster Reborn!

00:05:00.120 --> 00:05:03.220
I resurrect Rocket Warrior!

00:05:06.680 --> 00:05:09.570
Then Claw of Hermos!

00:05:18.510 --> 00:05:21.300
There it is, as expected.

00:05:21.300 --> 00:05:24.300
Attack me with all you got!

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:29.420
So when I destroy it, I'll achieve my greatest victory!

00:05:33.410 --> 00:05:35.680
Umm, I think this is the right way.

00:05:35.680 --> 00:05:37.920
Jonouchi!  Be safe!

00:05:41.410 --> 00:05:42.740
What's this?

00:05:48.180 --> 00:05:49.650
Jonouchi...

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:55.870
Due to its effect, Claw of Hermos fuses with Rocket Warrior!

00:06:11.630 --> 00:06:15.850
Rocket Hermos Cannon, equip and combine with Brigadier of Landstar!

00:06:21.140 --> 00:06:26.020
Combine?  Non-Armor Monsters can do that?

00:06:26.020 --> 00:06:27.970
It's too early to be surprised!

00:06:27.970 --> 00:06:29.870
Go, Brigadier of Landstar!

00:06:29.870 --> 00:06:32.370
Attack with Rocket Hermos Cannon!

00:06:32.900 --> 00:06:34.860
Destroy all your enemies!

00:06:42.970 --> 00:06:46.600
Emergency!  Opponent's attack is unavoidable!

00:06:47.500 --> 00:06:49.860
Damage estimate: All Armor destroyed.

00:06:59.740 --> 00:07:00.770
Did I do it?

00:07:09.120 --> 00:07:11.450
All right!  I beat him!

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:12.780
I win!

00:07:13.770 --> 00:07:16.150
So why hasn't the Seal vanished?

00:07:22.210 --> 00:07:23.340
You're...

00:07:24.800 --> 00:07:26.470
That one hurt.

00:07:26.470 --> 00:07:28.880
Hermos's power is impressive.

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:31.290
How?  You took a direct hit!

00:07:31.780 --> 00:07:34.300
Yes I did.

00:07:34.300 --> 00:07:38.540
But you forgot about Active Guard's effect.

00:07:46.590 --> 00:07:48.750
Because I have this.

00:07:48.750 --> 00:07:54.750
Active Guard's effect reduces the damage I take to 0.

00:07:56.250 --> 00:07:57.250
Oh yeah.

00:07:57.680 --> 00:08:00.260
Too bad, Jonouchi.

00:08:01.760 --> 00:08:03.260
I end my turn.

00:08:03.260 --> 00:08:06.260
But your Armor is gone!

00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:10.270
Yeah.  But I acquired something nice in return.

00:08:10.700 --> 00:08:12.270
Something nice?

00:08:12.270 --> 00:08:13.920
What’s that?

00:08:16.340 --> 00:08:18.270
Rocket Hermos Cannon!

00:08:18.270 --> 00:08:22.200
Data Brain isn’t just any Equip Spell!

00:08:22.200 --> 00:08:30.000
When your spell destroys the equipped monster, it unleashes its true effect!

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:31.520
What?

00:08:32.060 --> 00:08:37.130
It copies your spell's effect so I can use it!

00:08:38.760 --> 00:08:41.150
It's my turn!  I draw!

00:08:41.150 --> 00:08:42.600
During the Standby Phase...

00:08:42.600 --> 00:08:48.770
...Psychic Armor Head's effect lets me summon it from my graveyard in attack position!

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:57.980
Then I summon Burning Knuckle in attack position!

00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:09.340
Burning Knuckle gains 200 attack points  for every Armor Monster on the field!

00:09:09.340 --> 00:09:10.290
And...

00:09:13.920 --> 00:09:17.300
This is a nice weapon.  Allow me to use it.

00:09:19.300 --> 00:09:20.580
Here I go!

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:24.580
Destroy everything, Rocket Hermos Cannon!

00:09:47.380 --> 00:09:48.740
This is...

00:09:52.510 --> 00:09:56.170
This weapon created by a legendary dragon is impressive.

00:09:56.170 --> 00:09:59.520
Too bad I can only use it for one turn.

00:09:59.520 --> 00:10:03.480
Jonouchi, how does it feel to be defeated by your own weapon?

00:10:03.930 --> 00:10:08.330
You can't stand up, even though you have life points?

00:10:11.320 --> 00:10:14.490
You're tough.  I end my turn.

00:10:14.490 --> 00:10:17.490
But how long can you keep fighting?

00:10:17.490 --> 00:10:20.500
Just give up and be free of this.

00:10:20.500 --> 00:10:21.800
Never.

00:10:22.180 --> 00:10:26.250
I’ve told you that I won't run or hide.

00:10:26.250 --> 00:10:32.010
No matter how bad the situation, I won't give up until the end!

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:33.910
This guy…

00:10:35.780 --> 00:10:38.440
He's not scared of my attacks.

00:10:38.440 --> 00:10:41.750
Nobody has ever confronted me like this.

00:10:42.830 --> 00:10:46.520
This is who Mai is obsessed with.

00:10:47.240 --> 00:10:49.120
I'm far from done!

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:51.260
It's my turn!  I draw!

00:10:51.260 --> 00:10:55.110
The real fight starts now, Valon!

00:11:26.950 --> 00:11:28.760
Let’s go, Mokuba.

00:11:28.760 --> 00:11:30.120
Okay, big brother!

00:11:30.120 --> 00:11:31.700
H-Hey!

00:11:32.130 --> 00:11:34.030
What are you doing?

00:11:34.030 --> 00:11:36.750
We’ll buy this car.

00:11:41.320 --> 00:11:43.110
This should be enough.

00:11:45.220 --> 00:11:46.210
Hey!

00:11:49.930 --> 00:11:51.230
Buy it?

00:11:57.130 --> 00:12:00.130
Just wait, Doma!

00:12:02.840 --> 00:12:07.620
Did Critias's reaction mean something happened to that chump?

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:10.640
But I have no time to deal with that.

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:15.600
Just wait, Dartz!

00:12:15.600 --> 00:12:19.420
I'll end your stupid plan!

00:12:19.900 --> 00:12:23.420
This just may work...

00:12:24.050 --> 00:12:28.360
I set one card and end my turn!

00:12:28.360 --> 00:12:33.200
Seems you didn't draw a monster that you could summon.

00:12:33.200 --> 00:12:35.790
You’re fighting back in vain.

00:12:35.790 --> 00:12:40.100
Whether it's a trap or spell, I'll destroy it!

00:12:40.790 --> 00:12:42.100
It's my turn!

00:12:42.100 --> 00:12:43.390
I draw!

00:12:43.390 --> 00:12:47.670
I summon Black Hole Shield in attack position!

00:12:54.800 --> 00:12:58.240
This raises Burning Knuckle’s attack points!

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:02.320
Opponent’s field: Zero monsters.

00:13:02.320 --> 00:13:03.730
One set card.

00:13:03.730 --> 00:13:06.230
Trap card probability: 50%.

00:13:06.560 --> 00:13:09.730
Even if it's a trap, I’ll attack!

00:13:09.730 --> 00:13:12.010
Burning Knuckle attacks!

00:13:12.010 --> 00:13:14.000
I attack you directly!

00:13:14.000 --> 00:13:16.240
This will end it!

00:13:24.820 --> 00:13:25.980
What?

00:13:29.300 --> 00:13:31.990
I activated my trap card.

00:13:35.020 --> 00:13:37.730
The trap card, Aura Armor!

00:13:38.180 --> 00:13:40.130
That's...

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:42.060
Level 4 monster.

00:13:42.060 --> 00:13:43.680
400 attack points.

00:13:43.680 --> 00:13:47.460
I’ve decided to fight the same way as you.

00:13:47.460 --> 00:13:53.580
When I have 2000 or lower life points, Aura Armor activates when I’m attacked directly.

00:13:53.580 --> 00:14:00.880
My life points are halved, but it negates your attack and Special Summons a monster.

00:14:00.880 --> 00:14:02.650
This one!

00:14:03.230 --> 00:14:07.160
You can wear it, like my Armor Monsters?

00:14:07.620 --> 00:14:14.320
Unlike your Armor Monsters, its attack and defense points are equal to my life points.

00:14:14.320 --> 00:14:16.600
If I fall, I lose.

00:14:16.600 --> 00:14:17.900
Simple, right?

00:14:18.540 --> 00:14:19.730
I see.

00:14:19.730 --> 00:14:23.020
Last man standing wins.

00:14:23.020 --> 00:14:24.370
Interesting.

00:14:24.370 --> 00:14:26.400
I set a card!

00:14:27.240 --> 00:14:28.420
I end my turn!

00:14:30.920 --> 00:14:34.180
My Timaeus reacted to Hermos.

00:14:34.180 --> 00:14:36.920
Did something happen to Jonouchi?

00:14:36.920 --> 00:14:39.540
Please be safe, Jonouchi!

00:14:41.740 --> 00:14:43.660
It's my turn!  I draw!

00:14:44.180 --> 00:14:45.290
Nice!

00:14:45.290 --> 00:14:47.130
I activate my spell card!

00:14:47.130 --> 00:14:49.400
Roll of Fate!

00:14:51.810 --> 00:14:55.000
Roll of Fate lets me roll a die.

00:14:55.000 --> 00:15:00.240
I draw cards equal to the number I roll and discard the same amount from my deck.

00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:03.740
Four!

00:15:10.320 --> 00:15:12.480
What will he play?

00:15:13.230 --> 00:15:16.090
Here I go!  I activate my Ritual Spell Card!

00:15:16.500 --> 00:15:19.090
Red-Eyes Transmigration!

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:26.500
I tribute Red-Eyes B. Dragon and a Warrior-Type monster from my hand or field!

00:15:26.920 --> 00:15:28.500
A Ritual Spell?

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:35.010
I tribute this Red-Eyes and myself, since I’m wearing Aura Armor!

00:15:36.350 --> 00:15:37.440
Come out!

00:15:38.120 --> 00:15:39.950
Lord of the Red!

00:15:57.450 --> 00:15:58.660
What?

00:16:04.920 --> 00:16:05.910
Here I go!

00:16:05.910 --> 00:16:08.210
I attack Psychic Armor Head!

00:16:18.090 --> 00:16:20.320
This is the end!

00:16:20.850 --> 00:16:23.020
Black Hole Shield!

00:16:30.370 --> 00:16:32.310
Lord of the Red’s attack was...

00:16:35.810 --> 00:16:37.700
I activate my effect!

00:16:37.700 --> 00:16:42.880
I tribute Black Hole Shield to lower the damage I take to 0!

00:16:44.220 --> 00:16:46.310
I thought I beat him!

00:16:47.080 --> 00:16:48.890
I managed to survive.

00:16:52.520 --> 00:16:55.200
I’m shaking?

00:16:55.770 --> 00:16:58.890
Am I scared of him?

00:16:59.400 --> 00:17:00.880
No, it’s not that.

00:17:00.880 --> 00:17:03.400
It means I'm excited.

00:17:03.860 --> 00:17:07.630
I’ve never felt this kind of tension.

00:17:08.190 --> 00:17:12.910
Katsuya Jonouchi!  Dueling you is the best!

00:17:12.910 --> 00:17:15.910
I feel the same!  I’m excited!

00:17:15.910 --> 00:17:17.910
This is dueling!

00:17:18.810 --> 00:17:21.920
If only we were dueling for different reasons.

00:17:25.640 --> 00:17:26.810
Mai?

00:17:31.200 --> 00:17:33.820
How dare you, Valon!

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:35.760
I’m the one to duel Jonouchi!

00:17:36.570 --> 00:17:37.720
Mai!

00:17:38.640 --> 00:17:42.120
Switch places!  I'll duel Jonouchi!

00:17:42.120 --> 00:17:43.740
Stay back, Mai!

00:17:43.740 --> 00:17:44.640
What?

00:17:44.640 --> 00:17:48.420
I can't switch places when I’m having such a fun duel.

00:17:48.420 --> 00:17:50.860
Not even for you, Mai.

00:17:50.860 --> 00:17:51.980
Valon!

00:17:52.530 --> 00:17:57.290
I finally know why you're obsessed with Jonouchi.

00:17:57.290 --> 00:17:59.990
I learned by dueling him.

00:18:01.490 --> 00:18:04.760
He has something we don’t have.

00:18:05.280 --> 00:18:07.760
And that attracts you.

00:18:08.640 --> 00:18:12.970
His pure passion towards dueling.

00:18:12.970 --> 00:18:15.270
That’s what we don’t have.

00:18:16.280 --> 00:18:17.280
Valon...

00:18:19.820 --> 00:18:23.140
Let’s continue, Jonouchi!

00:18:23.690 --> 00:18:29.640
Right!  I set a card and end my turn!

00:18:30.030 --> 00:18:32.250
It's my turn!  I draw!

00:18:32.760 --> 00:18:35.250
The spell card, Monster Reborn!

00:18:35.250 --> 00:18:38.660
I resurrect Buster Pyle!

00:18:48.170 --> 00:18:51.120
It this attack succeeds, I win!

00:18:51.120 --> 00:18:52.640
Hold up!

00:18:53.070 --> 00:18:55.080
I flip over my set card!

00:18:55.080 --> 00:18:56.660
Scapegoat!

00:18:58.650 --> 00:19:02.070
You think you can stop my fist with those goats?

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:05.800
I didn’t play Scapegoat to run and hide.

00:19:13.660 --> 00:19:16.130
Lord of the Red's effect!

00:19:16.700 --> 00:19:19.890
Two spells were played this turn.

00:19:19.890 --> 00:19:24.240
It'll use the power of those spells to destroy all monsters!

00:19:24.240 --> 00:19:26.370
Two?  You don't mean...

00:19:28.760 --> 00:19:32.610
Yes.  It includes your spell card, Monster Reborn!

00:19:39.160 --> 00:19:40.020
What?

00:19:46.300 --> 00:19:49.470
I won't let you!  Buster Pyle!

00:20:17.640 --> 00:20:21.300
Impossible!  My invincible armor was destroyed?

00:20:24.130 --> 00:20:28.160
But I still have life points.

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:29.680
I end my turn!

00:20:29.680 --> 00:20:31.960
Bring it on, Jonouchi!

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:32.750
Sure!

00:20:33.190 --> 00:20:34.970
It's my turn!  I draw!

00:20:35.730 --> 00:20:37.210
I attack!

00:20:37.800 --> 00:20:39.250
Here I come, Valon!

00:20:39.250 --> 00:20:41.760
Direct attack!

00:20:43.650 --> 00:20:46.970
I activate my trap card!

00:20:46.970 --> 00:20:48.250
Extinction Fist!

00:20:48.250 --> 00:20:54.650
It ends the Ritual Monster’s Battle Phase and returns to the previous state!

00:21:03.450 --> 00:21:04.940
Extinction Fist!

00:21:21.270 --> 00:21:23.280
Lord of the Red...

00:21:39.990 --> 00:21:45.600
Jonouchi or Valon...  One strike will determine the winner.

00:21:57.900 --> 00:22:06.780
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:07.310 --> 00:22:15.150
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:16.880 --> 00:22:26.310
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:22:26.920 --> 00:22:35.800
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:22:36.400 --> 00:22:44.860
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:22:45.640 --> 00:22:50.370
I'll live feeling them

00:22:50.980 --> 00:22:55.520
For me to be me

00:22:55.520 --> 00:23:04.010
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:04.690 --> 00:23:09.650
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:10.170 --> 00:23:19.310
We'll both understand that someday

00:23:25.260 --> 00:23:29.860
In this heated battle, Jonouchi and Valon recognize each others' skills.

00:23:29.860 --> 00:23:33.210
Neither are focused on Mai anymore.

00:23:33.210 --> 00:23:37.120
Their willpower and life points are on the brink.

00:23:37.120 --> 00:23:40.680
The next strike will determine the winner.

00:23:40.680 --> 00:23:43.160
Valon equips Full Armor again.

00:23:43.160 --> 00:23:47.120
As their fists clash, who will be left standing?

00:23:47.120 --> 00:23:49.210
And what about Mai?

00:23:49.210 --> 00:23:51.370
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
After the Fight

00:23:51.370 --> 00:23:53.370
Duel, standby!
